<title>UK: Wet Brent sold weaker at Feb Brent - 30 cents.</title>
<headline>Wet Brent sold weaker at Feb Brent - 30 cents.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A wet Brent cargo loading Jan 18-20 traded late on Monday at Feb Brent -30 cents, traders said.</p>
<p>This compares with an earlier deal for a Brent cargo loading Jan 25-27 which fetched Feb Brent -10 cents.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
